NOT -- I DON'T KNOW WHAT THE

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.760
FACTS ARE.
I'VE ALREADY MADE UP MY MIND.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.529
AND SHE SAID SOMETHING VERY MUCH
TO THAT POINT.

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:49.402
SHE ALREADY MADE UP HER MIND
BEFORE SHE EVER WENT IN THAT HE

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:51.437
WAS GUILTY OF WHAT THEY SAY HE
DID.

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:54.941
&gt;&gt; BUT ARE YOU COMFORTABLE WITH
IT BEING INVESTIGATED?

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:59.412
&gt;&gt; INVESTIGATE AWAY.
JUST DON'T MAKE IT A SET-UP.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:05.685
THINGS DO NEED TO BE
INVESTIGATED.

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:10.556
BUT THEY NEED TO BE INVESTIGATED
FAIRLY.

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:12.725
&gt;&gt; AND DO YOU THINK THAT JOE
BIDEN IS THE LEGITIMATE WINNER

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:18.464
